"Clipy needs permission before it can monitor clipboard changes." = "Clipy 需要获得权限才能监控剪贴板变化。";
"Clipboard access needs your approval before monitoring can continue." = "需要你批准剪贴板访问，才能继续监控。";
"Clipboard monitoring is allowed." = "已允许监控剪贴板。";
"Clipboard access is denied, so monitoring is stopped." = "剪贴板访问被拒绝，监控已停止。";
"Clipy couldn't check clipboard access. Try again." = "Clipy 无法检查剪贴板访问权限，请重试。";
"Clipboard monitoring is paused for up to 5 minutes." = "剪贴板监控已暂停，最长持续 5 分钟。";
"Resume" = "恢复";
"Try Again" = "重试";
"Resume clipboard capture" = "恢复剪贴板采集";
"Retry clipboard access" = "重试剪贴板访问";
"Clipy, clipboard monitoring paused" = "Clipy，剪贴板监控已暂停";
"Dismiss capture warning" = "关闭采集警告";
"Clipboard Monitoring Unavailable" = "剪贴板监控不可用";
"Clipy replaced 1 pending clipboard change with a newer one, so it wasn't saved. To try again, copy the older content again." = "Clipy 用较新的剪贴板变化替换了 1 次待处理变化，因此较早的内容未保存。如需重试，请重新复制较早的内容。";
"Clipy replaced %@ pending clipboard changes with newer ones, so they weren't saved. To try again, copy the older content again." = "Clipy 用较新的剪贴板变化替换了 %@ 次待处理变化，因此较早的内容未保存。如需重试，请重新复制较早的内容。";
"Clipy can't save multiple clipboard items yet. Copy one item at a time." = "Clipy 暂不支持同时保存多个剪贴板项目，请每次复制一个项目。";
"Clipy couldn't read the complete clipboard change. Copy the content again to make a new attempt." = "Clipy 未能完整读取剪贴板变化，请重新复制内容以再次尝试。";
"A clipboard change wasn't saved. Clipy can't retry it automatically; copy the content again to make a new attempt." = "一次剪贴板变化未保存。Clipy 无法自动重试，请重新复制内容以再次尝试。";
